PathOpenInstrModuleDoc
    Version: 1
    Language: en
    Format: STF
    Purpose: WASI path_open emission for IR.PathOpen: 9 raw operands via EmitOperandRaw; positions 5–6 (fs_rights_base/fs_rights_inheriting rights) stay i64, the rest are wrapped as i32; import #2 call, result extension. Invoked via hook from EmitMemInstr for each instruction; filters by operation name itself.
    Provides
        Item: PathOpenInstr(state, ins) -> state
    DependsOn: EmitOperandRaw, Push, PushList, EmitU32LEB.
    Composition: Native include from modules/GenWasm/GenWasm.sir.
    Notes: Canonical path_open import type is typeidx 1 of the minimal rt.
